OL,3,ABattle to save the tiny, gooey snail
OL,4,Aonly found in one lake in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tiny snail found in only one lake in
OL,7,Fthe UK has been dubbed as precious as
OL,8,Fan Egyptian artefact as
OL,9,Fconservationists bid to save it.
OL,11,FSeveral British zoos are setting up
OL,12,Fso-called ark populations of the
OL,13,Fglutinous snail, one of Europe's rarest
OL,14,Fspecies, using creatures bred in a back
OL,15,Fgarden in Ceredigion.
OL,17,F"Beguiled by their cuteness,"
OL,18,Fconservationist Ian Hughes has made it
OL,19,Fhis "life-defining" mission to protect
OL,20,Fthe threatened mollusc, which was once
OL,21,Fwidespread in UK waters.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
